      "Morphs": ["w", "po", "chodzili"],
      "Judgment": "ungrammatical",
      "Source": ["svenonius-2004[(4d)]"]
    },
    {
      "ID": "svenonius2004_3a",
      "Lexeme_ID": "ponarazkaza",
      "Cell": "prs_1sg",
      "Form": "ponarazkaža",
      "Morphs": ["po", "na", "razkaža"],
      "Comment": "Two superlexical prefixes stacked on the quantized perfective stem razkaža 'narrate'. Svenonius glosses the outer po- DLMT; on Istratkova's own taxonomy the po- that stacks over na- is her attenuative po- (her (23c)), her delimitative po- does not stack.",
      "Source": ["istratkova-2004[Table 1]", "svenonius-2004[(3a)]"]
    },
    {
      "ID": "svenonius2004_3e",
      "Lexeme_ID": "izponaprerazkaza",
      "Cell": "prs_1sg",
      "Form": "izponaprerazkaža",
      "Morphs": ["iz", "po", "na", "pre", "razkaža"],
      "Comment": "Four superlexical prefixes stacked on the quantized perfective stem razkaža 'narrate'. The deepest razkaža stack Svenonius cites from Istratkova's data; the po- after iz- is her distributive po-.",
      "Source": ["istratkova-2004[Table 1]", "svenonius-2004[(3e)]"]
    },
    {
      "ID": "svenonius2004_58za",
      "Lexeme_ID": "zakuritj",
      "Cell": "inf",
      "Form": "zakuritj",
      "Morphs": ["za", "kuritj"],
      "Comment": "Inceptive za- almost never forms secondary imperfectives in Russian. Datum for his (58a-i): inceptive za- blocks secondary imperfectivization, consistent with attachment above the SI position.",
